    "title": "Fort Payne woman killed in three-vehicle crash on U.S. 11 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brady Flanigan ,\n2 days ago DEKALB COUNTY, Ala. — A woman from Fort Payne was killed Friday afternoon following a three-vehicle crash on U.S. 11. 70-year-old Colleen K. Jones was operating a 1999 Toyota Camry when it was hit by a 2007 Chevrolet Avalanche driven by 40-year-old John David Andrew, also of Fort Payne, according to the Alabama Law Enforcement […] Read full article",
